# Secrets
.env

# Raw data (immutable, large, personal) and the canonical DB — never committed.
# `data/health.db*` (not just the exact filename) so SQLite's WAL-mode sidecar
# files (`-wal`, `-shm`, `-journal`) are covered too — a plain `data/health.db`
# pattern missed these and one commit briefly included `data/health.db-wal`/
# `-shm` before this was caught and fixed (2026-08-28).
data/raw/
data/health.db*
data/.garth_tokens/
data/logs/

